# Files in this folder that are operator runbooks, not public docs.
# Mintlify would otherwise try to parse them as MDX and choke on the
# command snippets (e.g. `<your-subdomain>` reads like a JSX tag and
# blocks every deploy — see the 2026-05-29 build that failed on
# DEPLOY.md with "Unexpected character / (U+002F)").
DEPLOY.md
README.md
